---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section class="box skills">
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="terminal-window" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Closing Big Deals</h2>
		<p>Proven ability to consistently close high-value B2B deals ranging from $5K to $200K+ across agency and SaaS verticals. Expert in objection handling, urgency creation, and final-mile negotiation to drive revenue fast.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="trophy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Psychology in Sales</h2>
		<p>Deep understanding of psychological triggers and conversational control to build trust, uncover pain points, and guide prospects to decisions. Skilled in turning cold leads into engaged buyers through precision rapport and timing.</p>
	</div>
	<div class="stack gap-2 lg:gap-4">
		<Icon icon="strategy" color="var(--accent-regular)" size="2.5rem" gradient />
		<h2>Sales Engineering</h2>
		<p>Strong technical fluency to translate complex software, platforms, and services into clear ROI-driven solutions. Able to bridge the gap between client needs and product capabilities for faster closes and higher contract value.</p>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.box {
		border: 1px solid var(--gray-800);
		border-radius: 0.75rem;
		padding: 1.5rem;
		background-color: var(--gray-999_40);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
	}

	.skills {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 3rem;
	}

	.skills h2 {
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
	}

	.skills p {
		color: var(--gray-400);
	}

	@media (min-width: 50em) {
		.box {
			border-radius: 1.5rem;
			padding: 2.5rem;
		}

		.skills {
			display: grid;
			grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
			gap: 5rem;
		}

		.skills h2 {
			font-size: var(--text-2xl);
		}
	}
</style>
